  <item>
    <title>EP41 裸辞60天滚回去上班，2 个月 “边玩边赚” 后，我摸清了自由的边界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e4f2c08bf86095c512dd8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e4f2c08bf86095c512dd8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Oct 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>兜兜转转又聊到裸辞这个话题</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里有人不禁就要问了这个节目最开始不是想帮大家“找工作”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实不然，OfferShow是帮大家找工作，Offer引力在找工作的同时，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也想告诉大家停下来也没事，最好是拥有永远不上班的权力哈哈哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>过往不上班案例：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6834989131215eb506db99ad" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6834989131215eb506db99ad"><span>EP37 从负债上班到自由制片人</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678fa62bc3617f02a44d90e0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678fa62bc3617f02a44d90e0"><span>EP32 放弃大厂百万年薪后，靠“买买买”解锁财富密码</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6771527b15a5fd520e7b5ed9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6771527b15a5fd520e7b5ed9"><span>EP30 GAP指南：聊聊不上班的好处与坏处</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66eae8763a5ff0a0ca4cea03?s=eyJ1IjogIjY0ZjkyNjkzZWRjZTY3MTA0YWJjZjEyNiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66eae8763a5ff0a0ca4cea03?s=eyJ1IjogIjY0ZjkyNjkzZWRjZTY3MTA0YWJjZjEyNiJ9"><span>EP20 英专生月入10w，14年数字游民心得</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6618a69e48c40e2fb0cfc243?s=eyJ1IjogIjY0ZjkyNjkzZWRjZTY3MTA0YWJjZjEyNiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6618a69e48c40e2fb0cfc243?s=eyJ1IjogIjY0ZjkyNjkzZWRjZTY3MTA0YWJjZjEyNiJ9"><span>EP03 从通讯工程到自由摄影：自由职业的光鲜与暗面</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>在故事发生时，你需要先看见故事发生的可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>言归正传，欢迎本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b47008be8ac2b13a0a5bb36?xsec_token=ABKkfpsEkoJk555urGM-x-88QYj0My6XHs6DeJEcBBfZs%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b47008be8ac2b13a0a5bb36?xsec_token=ABKkfpsEkoJk555urGM-x-88QYj0My6XHs6DeJEcBBfZs%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>Ysuff小叔叔（👈点击跳转小红书主页）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>英专毕业</span></p><span></span><p><span>主业：海外营销，副业：小红书博主</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生经历：毕业一年存到10w fucking money，解锁裸辞两个月贵州-新疆-哈萨克斯坦旅居经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 被迫转岗与裸辞：个人职业规划与工作内容的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 个人职业选择与工作忍受度的差异探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 副业支撑与裸辞准备：生活与职业的平衡探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 裸辞后的新疆牧场兼职经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 旅行与工作中的新奇体验与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> 牧场工作体验与文化探索之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 从新疆到江苏：职业选择与副业平衡的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 裸辞后的自由与束缚：个人边界内的生活选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 裸辞两个月：探索生活与职场的平衡之道</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌱这是一档由OfferShow出品的职场访谈节目，用热爱的引力拉近与心动Offer的距离，在纷扰与振荡中破土生长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💫我们相信工作是为了更好地生活，通过对话处于不同人生阶段&amp;不同职业的人，期盼为生涯探索期的同学提供信息差与路径参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👌不论你是正处于/即将面临找工作的校招生或是已经工作几年的职场人，都欢迎加入我们的</span><a href="https://offershow.cn/community_site" data-url="https://offershow.cn/community_site"><span>offer社群</span></a><span>，一起讨论求职&amp;职场~你的订阅是我们前进的最大动力!</span></p>]]></description>
